{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F#m7]You're the [Gmaj7]God of the [Em]Universe.
[Bm]You're the [Gmaj7]Treasure of [Em]utmost worth.
[Bm]You're the [Gmaj7]Water for [A/C#]all my thirst, [D]and [G]I will praise [Bm7]You.
You're the [Gmaj7]Lord of the [Em]highest moun[Bm]tain.
You're the [Gmaj7]Knowledge of [Em]all that's hid[Bm]den.
You're the [Gmaj7]Source of e[A/C#]ternal wis[D]dom, and [G]I will praise [D]You.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
I'll [Gmaj7]praise You in the morning sun,
And [Aadd4]praise You when the day is done,
When night [Bm7]falls, You're always on my [D]mind.
[A/C#]And [Gmaj7]even as I close my eyes
And bid [Aadd4]another day goodbye
You'll find [Bm7]that I am still in[D]clined
To [F#m7]praise You all the time.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
You're the [Gmaj7]Artist of [Em]everything.
[Bm]You're the [Gmaj7]King over [Em]every king.
[Bm]You're the [Gmaj7]Song all cre[A/C#]ation sings, [D]and [G]I will praise [Bm7]You.
You're the [Gmaj7]Light in the [Em]darkest plac[Bm]es.
You're the [Gmaj7]Ruler of [Em]every na[Bm]tion.
You're the [Gmaj7]Author of [A/C#]my salva[D]tion, and [G]I will praise [D]You
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[Gmaj7]Praise to the Lord, the Al[A/C#]mighty,
The [Em]King of cre[A]a[Bm7]tion.
[Gmaj7]O, my soul, praise Him
For [A/C#]He is thy [Em]health and sal[A]va[D]tion!
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
You're the [Gmaj7]Voice when all else goes si[Bm]lent.
You're the [Gmaj7]Calm when the seas get violent.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 2}
[D]I'll [Gmaj7]praise You in the morning sun,
And [Aadd4]praise You when the day is done,
When night [Bm7]falls, You're always on my [D]mind.
[A/C#]And [Gmaj7]even as I close my eyes
And bid [Aadd4]another day goodbye
You'll find [Bm7]that I am still [D]inclined
[A/C#]To [Gmaj7]praise You in the morning sun,
And [Aadd4]praise You when the day is done,
When night [Bm7]falls, You're always on my [D]mind.
I'll [F#m7]praise You all the time.
{end_of_chorus}
